<a href="http://gangrey.com/1175">
<h2 class="design">Rescue Me</h2></a>
<h4 class="byline">start to finish</h4>

<p>

<a href="http://www.recordonline.com/apps/pbcs.dll/article?AID=/20070904/NEWS/709040317">Doyle Murphy</a> goes beyond a brief: <i>Warwick &#8212; Maureen Segota, her husband and three children picked their way along the path toward the water.<br />
<br />
A group of teenagers already had a spot on the shore, so the family hiked farther along. The Segotas had a busy weekend already. Saturday night they'd hosted a big party. They'd planned Labor Day afternoon at Cascade Lake as a way to slow down &#8212; a day for fishing and to relax a little. Eventually they came to the top of a hill and looked down on the water.</i>
